399-## 11. LLM-as-a-Judge Discipline
400-
401-Use judge-like qualitative evaluation only when:
402-- exact-match metrics are insufficient
403-- the output is open-ended but contract-bound
404-- rubric-based qualitative comparison is needed
405-- trajectory review needs nuanced interpretation
406-
407-Rules:
408-- use explicit criteria
409-- keep anchors visible
410-- separate factual scoring from style preference
411-- prefer comparative judging when absolute scales are unstable
412-- never treat a single judge score as unquestionable truth
